## JSON Schema

The format of `{{ include.file }}` is published as a JSON Schema at [{{ schema_url }}]({{ schema_url }}). Editors that support JSON Schema for YAML use it for completion, hover documentation and validation.

In VS Code with the [YAML extension](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=redhat.vscode-yaml), add to `.vscode/settings.json`:

```json
{
  "yaml.schemas": {
    "{{ schema_url }}": [{{ include.file_match }}]
  }
}
```

Alternatively, point to the schema from the file itself:

```yaml
# yaml-language-server: $schema={{ schema_url }}
```
